# sfa CLI Conventions

- Contract dataclasses: `lib/cli/contracts.py` — field names are stable
- Changing a contract field requires updating `AGENTS.md`, contract tests in
  `lib/tests/test_cli_contracts.py`, and any OpenClaw parsers
- All commands support `--json`; tests should assert JSON shape, not prose
- Research agent rules (OpenClaw): `docs/openclaw-research.md` — not for code edits
